_2024_quarters}\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> print(f\"2024 Average: {np.mean(pce_2024_quarters)}\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> print(\"\\nPFI Annual data:\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> print(f\"Count: {len(pfi_annual)}\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> print(f\"2024 Quarterly data: {pfi_2024_quarters}\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
